# Platform SaaS billing (P2-C)

Super Admin billing for club subscriptions — separate from Denali club `/finance/*`.

## Data model

| Table | Purpose |
|-------|---------|
| `platform_plans` | Plan catalog (`standard`, `enterprise`) |
| `tenant_subscriptions` | One row per tenant — plan, status, period end |

Provision hook: `createTenantSubscriptionOnProvision` after tenant create (plan `standard`, 30-day period).

## API

| Method | Path | RBAC |
|--------|------|------|
| GET | `/platform/v1/plans` | ops auth (all roles) |
| PATCH | `/platform/v1/tenants/{id}/subscription` | write (owner/admin) |
| POST | `/platform/v1/tenants/{id}/subscription/mark-paid` | owner only |
| POST | `/platform/v1/billing/run-past-due-check` | owner only |

Feature gate: `assertTenantPlatformFeature(tenantId, "custom_domain")` on domains POST — standard plan → **403** `PLATFORM_FEATURE_FORBIDDEN`.

## UI

Super Admin club detail → **Billing** tab (`data-tab="billing"`). Owner sees plan select + mark-paid; support/admin read-only.

Seed: `seedPlatformPlans()` via `db:seed`.

See also: [`platform-impersonation.mdoc`](platform-impersonation.mdoc) · [`platform-control-center-api.mdoc`](platform-control-center-api.mdoc)
